                                "sense_id": "7287540e-aa35-36c6-b594-9f25a9dcf0da",
                                "text": "The U.S. military's bombing of a Grenadan mental hospital struck me as significant in the type of target selected. […] Hearing accounts of this atrocity against Grenadan mental patients underscored for me the very real connections between imperialism, racism, and mentalism."
